  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Peer Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This cultural peer initiative brings together two independent cultural entities working on documenting and archiving of visual material (photo and film) in Lebanon. The overall goal is to contribute to the protection, accessibility and sustainability of photographic an film archives and practices by strengthening the overall infrastructure for these two entities and fostering collaboration in terms of sharing knowledge and expertise and building audience.</narrative>
  </description>
